    "# Email Spam Detection Using Machine Learning\n",
    "\n",
    "## 1. Introduction\n",
    "\n",
    "Email and SMS spam messages are unwanted messages that may contain advertisements, misleading offers, or fraudulent links. Detecting spam automatically helps users identify unwanted messages and reduce the risk of falling for scams.\n",
    "\n",
    "This project uses Natural Language Processing (NLP) and machine learning algorithms to classify text messages into two categories: **Spam** and **Ham** (legitimate messages).\n",
    "\n",
    "The UCI SMS Spam Collection dataset is used to train and evaluate the classification models.\n",
    "\n",
    "## 2. Objectives\n",
    "\n",
    "* Load and explore the spam message dataset.\n",
    "* Analyze the distribution of spam and legitimate messages.\n",
    "* Clean and preprocess text data.\n",
    "* Convert text into numerical features using TF-IDF.\n",
    "* Train Multinomial Naive Bayes and Logistic Regression classifiers.\n",
    "* Evaluate and compare model performance.\n",
    "* Test the trained model on new messages.\n"
   ]
  },
