    "## 3. Dataset Description\n",
    "\n",
    "The dataset used in this project is the **SMS Spam Collection** from the UCI Machine Learning Repository.\n",
    "\n",
    "It contains text messages labeled as either `spam` or `ham`.\n",
    "\n",
    "* **Ham:** Legitimate messages.\n",
    "* **Spam:** Unwanted or potentially fraudulent messages.\n",
    "* **Input feature:** Message text.\n",
    "* **Target variable:** Message label.\n",
    "\n",
    "The original dataset is provided as a tab-separated text file and is converted into CSV format for easier processing with pandas.\n",
    "\n",
    "The dataset contains approximately 5,574 messages, including 4,827 ham messages and 747 spam messages before any cleaning or filtering.\n"
   ]
