    "## 8. Model Building\n",
    "\n",
    "Two supervised machine learning classification algorithms are trained using the TF-IDF features.\n",
    "\n",
    "### 8.1 Multinomial Naive Bayes\n",
    "\n",
    "Multinomial Naive Bayes is a probabilistic classification algorithm commonly used for text classification. It estimates class probabilities using the features extracted from messages.\n",
    "\n",
    "It is computationally efficient and provides a useful baseline for spam detection.\n",
    "\n",
    "### 8.2 Logistic Regression\n",
    "\n",
    "Logistic Regression is a classification algorithm that estimates the probability of a message belonging to a particular class.\n",
    "\n",
    "It learns relationships between TF-IDF features and the target labels. Its performance is compared with Multinomial Naive Bayes to identify a suitable model for the dataset.\n"
   ]
